# bane-battle (Tandy, the port's functional suite and its big-battle benchmark): the user's saved game F
# (sessions/saves/, served to the oracle by tools/func.py) stands in the nave of the Temple of Bane at (11,9) facing
# east, in search mode, two trapdoors already opened. One step east is the third trapdoor (12,9): the clock below makes
# the party find it (the find is a dice roll per member; 12:00:16.58 misses it). Opening it and taking a hand axe
# brings High Priest Mace and his horde: 56 enemies (tools/maps/areas/temple_of_bane.py). Quick combat for ten party
# turns, with all the enemy turns between them; the party does not last much longer (the game ends at its death).
clock 12:00:18.33
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key F
wait 300
key UP
wait 20
shot trapdoor
key O
wait 60
shot opened
key ENTER
wait 60
shot treasure
key T
wait 60
shot loot
key T
wait 60
shot took
key E
wait 60
key E
wait 100
shot treasure-left
key N
wait 100
shot attack
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
shot q5
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
key Q
wait 30
shot q10
quit
